::SQL Cross Join::
Which product is returned in a join query that has no join condition
{
    =Cartesian
    ~Equi Join
    ~Theta Join
    ~None of the above
}

::SQL Cross Join::
For what reason might we want to use a cross join?
{
    ~for when we want to find matching records from two tables
    ~for when we want all information from two tables
    =for when we need to find all the possibilities of combining multiple records where the result set includes every row from each contributing table
    ~None of the above
}
